//MPCOMPL  JOB 1,NOTIFY=&SYSUID
//*-------------------------------------------------------------------
//* BUILD: COMPILE AND LINK-EDIT MPINTCLC INTO THE DEV LOAD LIBRARY.
//* CODE IS ONLY EVER BUILT IN DEV.  QA AND PROD RECEIVE THE SAME
//* LOAD MODULE THROUGH MPPROMOT - NEVER A RECOMPILE (SEE /endevor).
//* EXPECT RC=0 (RC=4 IS ACCEPTABLE IF ONLY INFORMATIONAL MESSAGES).
//*-------------------------------------------------------------------
//COMPILE  EXEC IGYWCL
//COBOL.SYSIN  DD DSN=&SYSUID..MPL.DEV.SRC(MPINTCLC),DISP=SHR
//LKED.SYSLMOD DD DSN=&SYSUID..MPL.DEV.LOAD(MPINTCLC),DISP=SHR
